    "category": "Salt-Free Descaler, 600,000 Gal, 15 GPM, 3/4-in NPT, City & Well",
    "badge": "Best Overall",
    "amazonUrl": "#",
    "pros": [
      "Listing states clear water limits: hardness, alkalinity, pH and iron",
      "Rated for up to 15 gallons per minute",
      "600,000-gallon, 6-year media life with a 6-year warranty",
      "No salt, backwash, drain line or electricity",
      "Designed, engineered and assembled in the USA, per the listing"
